\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3-Flash is a native multimodal model from Z.ai. It is suited for efficient coding and long-horizon agent tasks. Its hybrid sparse and linear attention architecture maintains accurate long-context behavior while reducing compute overhead.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does GLM 5.3 Flash cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash costs $0.0352/M input tokens and $0.50/M output tokens, with separate rates for Cache Read at $0.0232/M tokens.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the context length of GLM 5.3 Flash?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash has a 1,048,576 token context window. It supports up to 131,072 completion tokens.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does GLM 5.3 Flash support tool calling and structured outputs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. GLM 5.3 Flash accepts tools for function calling. It also supports structured outputs via a JSON schema in response_format.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What inputs and outputs does GLM 5.3 Flash support?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash accepts text, images, and video as input and returns text.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which providers serve GLM 5.3 Flash?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash is served by 31 providers on OpenRouter: Relace, inference.net, Sail Research, Open Inference, Wafer, DeepInfra, NovitaAI, StreamLake and 23 more. Requests are routed to the best available provider, with automatic failover to the others, and you can pin or exclude providers with provider routing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When was GLM 5.3 Flash released?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash was released on August 26, 2026.\"}}]}7d:[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"faq\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+129px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(var(--navbar-height)+70px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1u773s\",{\"d\":\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"p32p05\",{\"d\":\"M12 17h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-medium\",\"children\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],null]}],null,[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-border border-none p-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L85\",null,{\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"Was ZAI GLM-5.3 Flash the stealth model Ox Alpha?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the stealth model Ox Alpha was revealed to be ZAI's new model, GLM-5.3 Flash.\",\"isCustom\":true},{\"question\":\"What is GLM 5.3 Flash?\",\"answer\":\"GLM-5.3-Flash is a native multimodal model from Z.ai. It is suited for efficient coding and long-horizon agent tasks. Its hybrid sparse and linear attention architecture maintains accurate long-context behavior while reducing compute overhead.\",\"isCustom\":false},{\"question\":\"How much does GLM 5.3 Flash cost?\",\"answer\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash costs $0.0352/M input tokens and $0.50/M output tokens, with separate rates for Cache Read at $0.0232/M tokens.\",\"isCustom\":false},{\"question\":\"What is the context length of GLM 5.3 Flash?\",\"answer\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash has a 1,048,576 token context window. It supports up to 131,072 completion tokens.\",\"isCustom\":false},{\"question\":\"Does GLM 5.3 Flash support tool calling and structured outputs?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. GLM 5.3 Flash accepts `tools` for function calling. It also supports structured outputs via a JSON schema in `response_format`.\",\"isCustom\":false},{\"question\":\"What inputs and outputs does GLM 5.3 Flash support?\",\"answer\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash accepts text, images, and video as input and returns text.\",\"isCustom\":false},{\"question\":\"Which providers serve GLM 5.3 Flash?\",\"answer\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash is served by 31 providers on OpenRouter: Relace, inference.net, Sail Research, Open Inference, Wafer, DeepInfra, NovitaAI, StreamLake and 23 more. Requests are routed to the best available provider, with automatic failover to the others, and you can pin or exclude providers with [provider routing](/docs/features/provider-routing).\",\"isCustom\":false},{\"question\":\"When was GLM 5.3 Flash released?\",\"answer\":\"GLM 5.3 Flash was released on August 26, 2026.\",\"isCustom\":false}],\"modelPermaslug\":\"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash-20260826\",\"modelSlug\":\"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$86\"}}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"87:I[743425,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1zet098htcd4i.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ncwfr4wdrrub.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2xgvr_umi0kh_.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0fm-u2k-im7-i.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1m2s60egjx067.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1xgt1odsntw54.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2osv2vgv9ppxf.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3d265-i4j720s.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3d304w99n_8rh.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ean_2r1sqb1a.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3x8ioig9pq1hs.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2z37o0kvy2cxn.js\",\"/_next/static/im